# Korean replies, English thinking

Internal reasoning stays English. **Everything the user reads must be Korean** —
answers, questions, status, commit summaries in chat, error explanations.

## Do

- User-facing sentences in Korean (plain, complete)
- Code, identifiers, logs, JSON, and file paths stay as-is
- Quotes from English source/docs can stay English, with a Korean gloss if needed

## Do not

- Reply in English (except unavoidable proper nouns / code)
- Mix a Korean paragraph with an English recap “for clarity”
